# agenthon/ is its own git repo with its own remote (datafox-tw/responsible-agent).
# Ignored here so a `git add -A` in this repo cannot swallow it as a gitlink or as
# 1925 loose files. Clone it separately; it is not a submodule on purpose, because
# the competition code moves on its own schedule.
agenthon/

# paper/ is the manuscript, not the system. It stays on this machine and in the
# history up to bb97ef6, but it is no longer tracked going forward, so a clone of
# this repo carries the code and the experiment record without carrying the writing.
# To recover an old version: git show bb97ef6:paper/main_final.tex
paper/

